    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local population status of targeted globally threatened migratory waterbird species at the pilot sites based on annual peak counts</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 4: Local population status of targeted globally threatened migratory waterbird species at the pilot sites based on annual peak counts:
a) Liaohe River Estuary NR
&#x2022;	Saunders Gull VU (Breeding)
&#x2022;	Red-crowned Crane EN (Breeding, Stopover)
&#x2022;	Siberian Crane CR (Stopover)
&#x2022;	Far Eastern Curlew EN (Stopover)
&#x2022;	Great Knot EN (Stopover)
b) Yellow River Delta NR
&#x2022;	Saunders Gull VU (Breeding)
&#x2022;	Oriental Stork EN (Breeding)
&#x2022;	Red-crowned Crane EN (Wintering)
&#x2022;	Siberian Crane CR (Stopover)
&#x2022;	Far Eastern Curlew EN (Stopover)
&#x2022;	Great Knot EN (Stopover)
c) Chongming Dongtan NR
&#x2022;	Saunders Gull VU (Breeding)
&#x2022;	Hooded Crane VU (Wintering)
&#x2022;	Black-faced Spoonbill EN (Stopover)
&#x2022;	Far Eastern Curlew EN (Stopover)
&#x2022;	Great Knot EN (Stopover)
d) Dashanbao Black-necked Crane NR
&#x2022;	Black-necked Crane EN (Wintering)</narrative>
    </description>
